<title>USA: Outlook Group Corp Q2 Nov 29 oper loss.</title>
<headline>Outlook Group Corp Q2 Nov 29 oper loss.</headline>
<dateline>MENASHA, Wis. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	    $0.08     loss	 $0.14</p>
<p> Oper net loss		393     loss	   658</p>
<p> Revs			17,684		   20,296</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,649		    4,649</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 period ended November 30.</p>
<p>Q2 results exclude loss from discontinued operations of $0.13/shr vs gain of $0.07/shr.  </p>
<p>6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	  $  0.10     loss	 $0.17</p>
<p> Oper net loss		472     loss	   780</p>
<p> Revs			37,543		   40,644</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,649		    4,674</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results restated to classify the company's Outlook Foods Inc subsidiary as a discontinued operation.</p>
<p>Six-month results exclude loss from discontinued operations of $0.20/shr vs gain of $0.08/shr.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
